{"content":[{"c":["MASSAH AND MERIBAH"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Two Hebrew words meaning, respectively, “to put to the test” and “to find fault, quarrel.” According to ",{"href":"?bref=Exod.17.7","r":"Exod.17.7","rawR":"Exod.17.7","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Exod.17.7","value":"Exod.17.7"}],"t":"ref","v":"Exodus 17:7"},", after Moses got water from the rock at Rephidim, he called the place by these two names to memorialize the Israelites’ “testing” of God’s faithful provision."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"},{"c":["Massah is mentioned four times as the site of the rebellious rejection of God by the Israelites (",{"href":"?bref=Deut.6.16","r":"Deut.6.16","rawR":"Deut.6.16","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Deut.6.16","value":"Deut.6.16"}],"t":"ref","v":"Dt 6:16"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Deut.9.22","r":"Deut.9.22","rawR":"Deut.9.22","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Deut.9.22","value":"Deut.9.22"}],"t":"ref","v":"9:22"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Deut.33.8","r":"Deut.33.8","rawR":"Deut.33.8","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Deut.33.8","value":"Deut.33.8"}],"t":"ref","v":"33:8"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.95.8","r":"Ps.95.8","rawR":"Ps.95.8","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.95.8","value":"Ps.95.8"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ps 95:8"},"). In contrast, ",{"href":"?bref=Num.20.13,24","r":"Num.20.13,24","rawR":"Num.20.13,24","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Num.20.13,24","value":"Num.20.13,24"}],"t":"ref","v":"Numbers 20:13, 24"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Num.27.14","r":"Num.27.14","rawR":"Num.27.14","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Num.27.14","value":"Num.27.14"}],"t":"ref","v":"27:14"},"; and ",{"href":"?bref=Deut.32.51","r":"Deut.32.51","rawR":"Deut.32.51","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Deut.32.51","value":"Deut.32.51"}],"t":"ref","v":"Deuteronomy 32:51"}," place Meribah near Kadesh in the wilderness of Zin where Moses struck the rock twice to produce water. ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.81.7","r":"Ps.81.7","rawR":"Ps.81.7","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.81.7","value":"Ps.81.7"}],"t":"ref","v":"Psalm 81:7"}," and ",{"href":"?bref=Deut.33.8","r":"Deut.33.8","rawR":"Deut.33.8","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Deut.33.8","value":"Deut.33.8"}],"t":"ref","v":"Deuteronomy 33:8"}," suggest that God was testing the Israelites in these instances."],"sourceClass":"","t":"p"},{"c":[{"c":["See also"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=Meribah_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"Meribah_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"Meribah_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Meribah"},"."],"sourceClass":"","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"MassahandMeribah","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Exodus 17:7","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Exod.17.7","rawQueryValue":"Exod.17.7","sourceRefExact":"Exod.17.7"},{"anchorText":"Dt 6:16","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Deut.6.16","rawQueryValue":"Deut.6.16","sourceRefExact":"Deut.6.16"},{"anchorText":"9:22","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Deut.9.22","rawQueryValue":"Deut.9.22","sourceRefExact":"Deut.9.22"},{"anchorText":"33:8","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Deut.33.8","rawQueryValue":"Deut.33.8","sourceRefExact":"Deut.33.8"},{"anchorText":"Ps 95:8","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ps.95.8","rawQueryValue":"Ps.95.8","sourceRefExact":"Ps.95.8"},{"anchorText":"Numbers 20:13, 24","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Num.20.13,24","rawQueryValue":"Num.20.13,24","sourceRefExact":"Num.20.13,24"},{"anchorText":"27:14","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Num.27.14","rawQueryValue":"Num.27.14","sourceRefExact":"Num.27.14"},{"anchorText":"Deuteronomy 32:51","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Deut.32.51","rawQueryValue":"Deut.32.51","sourceRefExact":"Deut.32.51"},{"anchorText":"Psalm 81:7","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ps.81.7","rawQueryValue":"Ps.81.7","sourceRefExact":"Ps.81.7"},{"anchorText":"Deuteronomy 33:8","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Deut.33.8","rawQueryValue":"Deut.33.8","sourceRefExact":"Deut.33.8"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"f3f050bbee62db637a6461d7ced69efee1757720e25ae6d77d52185abe20a3e2","sourceItemName":"MassahandMeribah","sourceItemOrder":165,"sourceMember":"Articles/M.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"MassahandMeribah","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Massah and Meribah","title":"Massah and Meribah","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}